00:10:36,917 --> 00:10:39,372
So how did college sports get a

292
00:10:39,372 --> 00:10:42,427
twenty million dollar payroll?

293
00:10:42,677 --> 00:10:45,480
Because a court decided the old rules

294
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:46,473
could not stand,

295
00:10:46,473 --> 00:10:48,857
